@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

'Title and header
title Buffer Data Port Register (Offset 020h)

' Register diagram
rectangle "Buffer Data Port Register" {
  card register1 [
    <size:12><b>D31 ──────────────────────────────────────────── D00</b></size>
    ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
    <size:11>Buffer Data</size>
  ]
}

note bottom of register1
  **Figure 2-8 : Buffer Data Port Register**
  
  Buffer can be accessed through 32-bit <i>Data Port</i> register.
end note

' Table with register field explanation
rectangle "Table 2-13 : Buffer Data Port Register" {
  card table1 [
    <b>Location | Attrib | Register Field Explanation</b>
    ═════════════════════════════════════════
    31-00 | RW | <b>Buffer Data</b>
          |    | The Host Controller buffer can be accessed 
          |    | through this 32-bit <i>Data Port</i> register.
          |    | Refer to Section 1.7
  ]
}

register1 -down-> table1

